Vendored OpenSCAD libraries
===========================

Seven upstream OpenSCAD libraries are vendored unmodified under
`openscad/vendor/`. Each one keeps its upstream LICENSE and a `REVISION` file
that records the pinned commit, the license, the copyright holder and the
vendored file list; the same revisions are registered in the `libraries` map
of `openscad/catalog.json` and are checked by the test suite. These libraries
remain under their own licenses and are not relicensed under AGPL-3.0-only.

